  "notes": "Hand-finished from providers/cockroachdb/routines.py. A routine resource is named name(arguments); the record keeps the bare name and the signature. Types and defaults come from SHOW CREATE ALL ROUTINES, matched to pg_proc by name and parameter names; flags and the body from pg_proc. Round trip verified live on CockroachDB 26.1.3 by tools/tests/test_ui_descriptor_roundtrip_cockroachdb.py (2026-10-30)."
